    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CESSNA AIRCRAFT PLANT. WICHITA, KANSAS 59",
      "This plant has contracts running into many\nmillions for planes for both U. S. and Canadian\ngovernments.\nThere are three additional air-\ncraft factories in Wichita, Beech Aircraft Co.,\nCulver Aircraft Co., Stearman Aircraft Division\nof Boeing Airplane Co., employing over 15,000\nmen.\nPUB. BY\nM-S NEWS CO., WICHITA, KANSAS\nNATURAL COLOR POST CARD MADE IN U. S. A. BY E. C. KROPP CO., MILWAUKEE, WIS. - (ECL)\n31864\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\n2014\n2428"
